    <h2>What I collect</h2>
    <p>When you fill out a form on this site, I get what you type in: your name, business name, email, phone, website and message. It's sent to my email inbox so I can reply.</p>
    <p>The site uses Google Analytics to count visits and see which pages people use. Google Analytics uses cookies and collects things like the pages you view, your browser and your general location. It doesn't give me your name or email.</p>
    <h2>What I do with it</h2>
    <p>I use what you send to reply to you and to work on your project. I don't sell it or share it with anyone for their marketing.</p>
